	"hardwareControls": [
		"Oscillators: DDS 1 Waveform, DDS 1 Super, DDS 2 Waveform, DDS 2 Tune",
		"Filter: HPF, VCF Freq, VCF Res, VCF Env",
		"Envelopes: ENV 1 Attack, ENV 1 Decay, ENV 1 Sustain, ENV 1 Release",
		"Performance: Master Volume, Arpeggiator, Sequencer, Hold",
		"Lower Layer (Selected): DDS 1 Waveform, VCF Freq, VCF Res, ENV 1 Attack"
	],
	"notice": "Set MIDI channel, parameter transmit/receive options and clock source in the global settings. Use either USB MIDI or DIN MIDI; simultaneous use is not supported by the linked manual. Set layer channels and keyboard mode for split or dual operation. Only selected controls from the two physical layer panels are drawn.  Exact browser MIDI port aliases have not been verified; select this profile manually. DIN-connected instruments appear under the interface port name. Physical controls are unbound; this profile does not provide a complete MIDI implementation. Diagrams show selected controls at illustrative positions; consult the manufacturer references for the full panel.",
